  "review": { "authority": "first_party_published", "method": "dual_reviewer", "reviewers": [{ "id": "spec-registry-rebuild-lane-20260819", "reviewedOn": "2026-08-19" }, { "id": "normalization-review-20260829", "reviewedOn": "2026-08-29" }], "notes": "Normalized from the 2026-08-19 rebuild research. Four adjudications carry into this revision. The upload slots publish no shot type, so no slot is asserted from them; the single slot here is derived from the instruction to pull long hair back for profile images, and is recorded as preferred rather than required because the source never says a profile image is mandatory. Guardian permission is published as a requirement and is modelled as one, but the form captures nothing about a guardian and a minor's date of birth changes nothing in it - the unknown records that gap rather than letting the rule imply the form will ask. Requiredness comes only from asterisks inside label text; fields without one are recorded as present with unknown requiredness, never as optional. Two facts have no home in this schema and are recorded here instead: the form's Ethnicity select, which has no taxonomy field, and the Contact page's Submissions link, which points at jagmodels.com/submissions - a different agency - and is the strongest case in this dataset for publishing an agency's verified official link. legalName is the NY DOL registrant name verbatim, including the register's own misspelling of Management." }
